methods\ that\ are\ declared\ in\ classes\ that\ are\ annotated\ with\ @RestController\ and\ are\ public\ should\ return\ a\ named\ type\ instead\ of\ a\ map\ or\ Object,\ because\ the\ OpenAPI\ contract\ and\ the\ web,\ admin\ and\ mobile\ clients\ need\ named\ types.\ Fix\:\ return\ a\ record\ from\ <feature>/controller,\ e.g.\ UserResponse=faf73bc4-2461-427b-9e1d-6bab822b040a
no\ classes\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'java.util.Date'\ or\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'java.util.Calendar'\ or\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'java.sql.Timestamp'\ or\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'java.sql.Date'\ or\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'org.joda.time..',\ because\ java.time\ is\ immutable\ and\ time-zone\ explicit.\ Fix\:\ use\ Instant,\ LocalDate\ or\ ZonedDateTime\ and\ convert\ at\ the\ boundary=d60c0a5b-1cca-4b57-bb54-8c01a01649c1
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['com.chat..service..',\ 'com.chat..infra..']\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.chat..controller..',\ because\ controllers\ are\ the\ outermost\ layer\ and\ their\ DTOs\ are\ an\ HTTP\ contract.\ Fix\:\ pass\ domain\ types\ or\ a\ service-level\ record\ instead\ of\ controller\ DTOs,\ and\ map\ in\ <feature>/mapper\ or\ the\ controller=61c8c977-4511-4ca9-b2ea-8e4148200542
slices\ matching\ 'com.chat.(*)..'\ should\ be\ free\ of\ cycles,\ because\ a\ cycle\ means\ neither\ module\ can\ change\ or\ be\ tested\ alone.\ Fix\:\ move\ the\ shared\ type\ to\ com.chat.common,\ or\ publish\ a\ domain\ event\ instead\ of\ calling\ back=59bd3fcf-fb91-4676-9bd1-010972940489
